=2 Walkthrough
* Entering {z:Norg} will trigger a cutscene.
** If you previously chose to postpone the cut-scene, use {p:Tales' Beginning} which is located near Home Point #1 in {z:Norg} to resume the story.

=2 Traveling to Norg
* {z:Norg} is located on {p:Elshimo Island|Elshimo}, which can be reached one of the following ways:
** {@k} {k:Kazham Airship Pass} to travel from {z:Port Jeuno} to {z:Kazham}.
** If you are on or past {M:Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Mission 1-5|Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Mission 1-5|The Beginning}, {n:Pacomart} and {n:Tonasav} can transport you to {z:Norg}.
* Additional methods become available once either of the above two conditions are met:
** {p:Waypoints|Waypoint} in {p:Adoulin|Category:The Sacred City of Adoulin} after purchasing the {@k} {k:Norg warp rune} or {@k} {k:Kazham warp rune}.
** {p:Unity Warp} after completion of 10 {p:Records of Eminence|Category:Records of Eminence} objectives and joining a {p:Unity}.
*** {z:Sea Serpent Grotto} in the CL 125 category is closest.
* NOTE: You must be minimum rank 6 in your home nation in order to continue any further from here.

